,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:45.17,0:01:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz daha alın.Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria?Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.51,0:01:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, niye görevinde değilsin?Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.13,0:01:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hangi görevmiş o?Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim ahmak oğlumu bulmak!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.22,0:02:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, bu daha iyi değil mi, Başkomutan Kaido?Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.10,0:02:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aramayı bensiz de halledebilirler.Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada olmayı yeğlerim.Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.78,0:02:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi be! İşleri bi' kenara bırakıp eğlenmenin zamanıdır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değil mi, Orochi?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harika bir gün!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.62,0:02:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklısın, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.00,0:02:34.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yirmi yıldır peşimizi bırakmayan Kozuki Hanesi'nin hayaletleri nihayet yok oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.05,0:02:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün kutlama günü!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.05,0:02:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro onları son ana kadar kandırdı...Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.56,0:02:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve yirmi yıllık emeğinin ardından kariyerini tamamladı!Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.52,0:02:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kınlar'ı sulara gömen kaptanlarla gelmesi yakındır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Etkileyici biri!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.53,0:03:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onunla karşılaştığımızda farkında olmadan onu öldürebilirdim!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.70,0:03:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzücü olan şu ki… Tüm o güvene rağmen,Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.21,0:03:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden ona hiç açılmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.50,0:03:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhtemelen hizmetkârlarına da o konuda bir şey anlatmamıştır.Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.01,0:03:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeyi mi diyorsun...?Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.47,0:03:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.22,0:03:23.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın ulaştığı son ada olan Laugh Tale'in konumunun anahtarı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Affedersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama'yla konuşmalıyım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.32,0:03:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay! Geldin demek, Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu daha önce görmemiştim.Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaşmak için mi geldin?Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakin olun, ahmaklar!Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi'nin adamı o!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.67,0:03:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun zaman oldu, Orochi-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.59,0:04:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Malikâne o kadar büyük ki sahne arkasında kayboldum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.22,0:04:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni bilmeden düşman belleyen herkesi kesip biçmem gerekti.Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusuruma bakmayın.Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.27,0:04:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, hiç önemli değil!Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo! Görüyorum ki bir şey getirmişsin...Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsteğiniz üzere, Kozuki Momonosuke.Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in oğlu.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.79,0:04:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelirken iplerini kesip kaçmaya kalkışınca onu bayıltmak zorunda kaldım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin, yaşıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.26,0:04:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek eski Kozuki efendinin varisine böyle davranıyorsun...Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar da soğuk ve kalpsizsin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perde kapandı, o artık gözümde herhangi bir enikten farksız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne sürpriz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.15,0:04:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni çok iyi hatırlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.65,0:05:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yirmi yıl önce savaştığım Dokuz Kızıl Kın'dan birisin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.28,0:05:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelelim sana... Seni de gayet iyi hatırlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:12.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baban çok cesurdu ama sen rezilin tekisin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.63,0:05:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıldır gram değişmemişsin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.26,0:05:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle. İyi bir soyadına sahip...Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,acınası bir veletten fazlası değil.Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni zavallı şey.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanaması var. Küçücük çocuğa nasıl bu kadar sert davranırsın?Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.15,0:05:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçme vakti! Hadi kadeh kaldıralım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.90,0:05:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun süre casus rolünü iyi oynadın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aferin sana!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.87,0:05:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, Orochi-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kınlar'ın planını engellemeyi başaramadım...Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.75,0:05:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,çünkü Hasır Şapkalar ve müttefikleri tarafından pusuya düşürüldük!Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Başaramadın mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:06:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsyancı birlikler, 5.400 kişilik bir kuvvetle Onigashima'ya doğru harekete geçti!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kabul edilemez!Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.85,0:06:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Planlarını engellemeyi başaramadın mı yani?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.64,0:06:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.27,0:06:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tokage Limanı'nda buluşacaklarını söyleyen sendin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden onları yok etmedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.99,0:06:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kin'emon beni kandırdı!Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu uzun zamandır tanıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.41,0:06:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama askeri dehasını hafife almışım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bahanelerini kendine sakla!Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cevap ver bana, Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.38,0:06:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuray filosu Onigashima'ya ulaştı mı?Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası hâlâ emniyetli görünüyor, Orochi-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.89,0:06:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Limanda şüpheli gemiler yok.Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.73,0:06:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak üç savaş gemimiz hâlen dönmedi.Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.73,0:07:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ek olarak, Gösteri Katı'nda dört korsan olduğu teyit edildi.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.37,0:07:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan Avcısı Zoro.Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eustass "Kaptan" Kid.Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Katliam Askeri Killer.Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.26,0:07:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalan mürettebatlarının da adada olması yüksek ihtimal.Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.51,0:07:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu bildiğin hâlde neden önceden söylemedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-dono bizzat ilgileniyordu,Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.31,0:07:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu yüzden ziyafetinizi bozmayı istemedim.Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.77,0:07:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada olsunlar ya da olmasınlar, tüm güçlerimiz Onigashima'da.Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.86,0:07:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olursa olsun, ülkedeki en korunaklı yerdeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru söyledin!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İç hadi, Orochi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.62,0:08:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buyrun, kadehinizi doldurayım.Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.50,0:08:07.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır... Teselli istemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.30,0:08:11.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet samurayların öldürüldüğüne dair bir rapor istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.10,0:08:15.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy adaya varmış...Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalmalısın...Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.81,0:08:22.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni mutlaka kurtaracağım!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçmam gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.15,0:08:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria!Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu bana ver.Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.57,0:08:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Unutmamamız gerekirdi, düşmanlarımızın lideri buydu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.87,0:08:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İdama hazırlayın!Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.92,0:08:47.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilinen son Kozuki ferdi de öldüğünde geriye kalan tüm bağlılık da yok olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.47,0:08:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve her şey nihayet bitmiş olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.76,0:08:54.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba...!Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen misin, Kedi?! Geciktin!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha yeni mi vardın?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.19,0:09:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.57,0:09:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şelaleyi daha yeni tırmandık!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.91,0:09:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Günden ve saatten haberin var mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.58,0:09:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş Festivali gecesindeyiz, yani büyük savaşa tam zamanında geldik, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.84,0:09:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen-gara varana kadar bunu söylememelisin!Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.09,0:09:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'nın kuzeybatı hududuna doğru yola koyulduk bile.Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı! Orada görüşürüz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.43,0:09:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, bekle.Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.56,0:09:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, hey!Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kedi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.77,0:09:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabırsızlığı hâlâ aynı.Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım baskına zamanında yetişebilirler.Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrı düştüğümüzden beridir Kediciği hiç görmedim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.74,0:09:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim o da Köpecik kadar büyümüştür.Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.45,0:09:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet kedi... Buraya olabildiğince hızlı varırsa iyi eder!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.41,0:10:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arka geçide yakında varacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.12,0:10:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Girdaplar yüzünden, normal gemiler adaya sadece ön taraftan ulaşabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.84,0:10:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım Kin'emon ve Denjiro arka geçite güvenle varırlar.Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.80,0:10:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım! Hep birlikte Oden-sama'nın dileğini gerçekleştirmek istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen güvende olun.Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes iyi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, iyiler.Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.12,0:10:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkesin adaya vardığını söyledi, yani baskın başlamış durumda!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.08,0:10:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O ıssız adanın adı artık Onigashima, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.83,0:10:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benden önce yola çıkmanıza rağmen aynı anda vardık.Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.42,0:10:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galiba Hasır Şapkalı Luffy'e mesajımı kendim ileteceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklısın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.05,0:11:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu notu atıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.73,0:11:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta gelebildiğine inanamıyorum, Marco.Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.61,0:11:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, her zaman Oden'e hayranlık duymuşumdur.Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.20,0:11:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama ülkenin bu kadar değişmiş olmasına inanamıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.95,0:11:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkede olup bitenler denizleri aşamıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.58,0:11:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O ihtişamlı Wano'nun bu hâle düştüğünü bilmiyordum...Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi Kaido yüzünden.Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.96,0:11:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Madem kararlısın, hemen Onigashima'yı basalım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkese yetişmemiz gerekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elden ne gelir ki?Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baskın zaten başladı.Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.93,0:11:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşman hattını yarıp onlara nasıl yetişeceğiz?Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.81,0:11:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana güven.Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir planım var.Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.61,0:11:59.41,Narrator-207+,,0,0,1,,Planlandığı gibi, Denjiro kalenin arka geçidinde güney güçlerine liderlik ediyor.Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada bir kapı var!Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gizlenin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rütbeli mi?Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet şansa bak.Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.46,0:12:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Onu olabildiğince çabuk bulun.Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.34,0:12:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne! – Başüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam tersi, şanslıyız gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu tanıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onunla konuşacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.93,0:12:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim var orada?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.80,0:12:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, benim.Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen...?Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Epey zaman oldu...Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.10,0:12:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sasaki!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.73,0:12:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yıl gelmeyeceksin diye duymuştum.Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu aramızda kalsın.Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.07,0:12:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öylece sızdın mı? O pek övündüğün fiyakalı saçlarına ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.03,0:12:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi birini ziyafetten ayrı görmek alışılmadık.Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.74,0:12:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. Kaido-san'ın çocuğu kayboldu.Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine de bir içkiye ne dersin?Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.71,0:12:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizler Kafatası Kubbesi'ne geri dönün!Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size sonra katılırım.Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.55,0:12:59.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Malikâne planında olmayan bir kapı. Ve Tobi Roppo'dan Sasaki.Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.97,0:13:05.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşman, Kyoshiro'ya bu kadar güveniyor olmasaydı...Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.26,0:13:08.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,bu engellerin aşılması oldukça zor olurdu.Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz taşı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun, Kyoshiro?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.23,0:13:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bağlayın onu!Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.48,0:13:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne! – Başüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor?! Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çenesini de kapatın.Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.03,0:13:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne! – Başüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cevap ver, Kyoshiro!Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.20,0:13:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sasaki...Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.08,0:13:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun tarihine ne kadar hâkimsin?Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa bu..?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlü bir Tobi Roppo üyesini bağladıktan sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.13,0:13:45.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,tıpkı doğu güçleri gibi, Denjiro da güçlerini ikiye böldü.Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.85,0:13:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kubbeye buradan girin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi şanslar!Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.77,0:13:55.94,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylece güney güçleri Kaido'ya doğru giderek yaklaşıyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.53,0:14:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş!Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçmanıza izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramayacağını biliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii ki yaramaz!Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.35,0:14:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gittiler!Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Choniki!Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.14,0:14:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne vahşi, olgun bir kadın...Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.65,0:14:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar korkmuş olmalarına rağmen onu ters yöne doğru çekmeyi başardılar.Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.77,0:14:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size borçluyuz, Kumandan Chopper, Sürücü Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devam edelim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet! – Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.95,0:14:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet! Sakın fedakârlıklarını boşa çıkarmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, seyirci mi kalacağız?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.83,0:14:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım o canavarımsı olgun kadınla bizimkilerin başa çıkabilmesi çok zor!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom bu yani!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.55,0:15:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden biz de bir şey yapamayız!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.05,0:15:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu bizden uzaklaştırdıkları için mutlu olalım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.30,0:15:09.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada burası neden bu kadar sıcak?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! Yukarı bak!Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başımız dertte!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi buldum!Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.48,0:15:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus'u kaçıran kadını buldum, Mama!Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.44,0:15:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaş, Pay-Pay! Savaş, Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Git de başka yerleri ara, mankafa!Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlayamadım, Pay-Pay?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.41,0:15:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana mankafa mı dedin sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.37,0:15:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.58,0:15:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla koşamayacağım...Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.21,0:15:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay! Çok yoruldum ben!Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.21,0:15:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yazık bana!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafamı şişirme!Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.51,0:15:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yorulduysan otur oraya!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni sırtında...Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.60,0:15:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hass.Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.89,0:15:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...taşımayı teklif etmeliydin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.27,0:16:01.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, in üstümden! Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle! Bırak beni! Abla!Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.78,0:16:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni küçük...Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.99,0:16:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Dur! Ciddiyim!Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.33,0:16:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay! Pay-Pay! Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.33,0:16:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle kal, benimle kal, benimle kal!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.25,0:16:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, canım Pay-Pay'im!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.13,0:16:29.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da neydi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.47,0:16:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay, beni korumak için kendini feda etti!Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.73,0:16:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin lan?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.52,0:16:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl sen kimsin?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.37,0:17:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte karşımızda... Onigashima.Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.33,0:17:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King...Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco...Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka...Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendilerini hazırlasalar iyi olur-perorin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama'nın ittifakını da onaylamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.18,0:17:18.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son sözü Big Mom Korsanları söyleyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.69,0:17:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağız, Usopp?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.90,0:17:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, Nami ve diğerlerinin peşine düştü!Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım Zeus'u geri almaya çalışıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar için endişeleniyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.11,0:17:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize yumruğu çakınca dönüşüm mekanizması tetiklendi galiba!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.79,0:17:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey, iyi olacaklar. Hem Sanji de onlarla.Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, he?Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.37,0:17:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım kadın peşinde koşacağına Momonosuke'yi kurtarmayı hatırlar.Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pek mümkün değil gibi...Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.76,0:17:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama ona güvenelim.Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.76,0:18:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon'un takımı ilerleyebildi, yani görev başarılı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brachio Tankı'nın ne kadar yetenekli olduğunu göstermiş olduk!Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.61,0:18:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle! Brachio Tankı 5'in başında Komutan Chopper ve nişancı Usopp var!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.49,0:18:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse yolumuzda duramaz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelin bakalım...Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.13,0:18:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşlı şemsiye...Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.09,0:18:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eski püskü takunyalar ve leş gibi sandaletler...Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pasaklı duvar...Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalnız mum...Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.48,0:18:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir de lamba...Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizlere hayat bahşediyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.70,0:19:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni takip edin.Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.71,0:19:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama, bu tarafa!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.34,0:19:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Big Mom'ı çağırmasana, güneş!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmalıyım, Nami?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.43,0:19:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni yakalarsa biterim!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.52,0:19:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu aşırı kocamış kadın cidden o kadar tehlikeli mi?Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamen farklı bir seviyede!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.44,0:19:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, az önce Sanji-kun'u görmemiş miydik?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.40,0:19:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.65,0:19:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, ama...Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.11,0:19:38.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi endişelendirdiğim için üzgünüm...Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadınları bulmaktan vazgeçmeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.25,0:19:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya ne diye geldi ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.33,0:19:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boş verin onu. Şuradan kaçıp Momonosuke-sama'yı bulmalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.00,0:19:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.26,0:20:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama! Bu taraftan!Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.06,0:20:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aceleye gerek yok.Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.68,0:20:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gösteri Katı az ileride.Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçacak yerleri yok.Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.37,0:20:22.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu heriflerin bir çoğu güç kullanıcısı...Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.00,0:20:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize Yetenekliler diyebilirsin.Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.38,0:20:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizler de bir zamanlar Korsanlar Kralı olmayı hedefliyorduk.Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.84,0:20:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama'ya biat edersen senin için her şey daha kolay olur.Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.55,0:20:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neredeyse 500 kişi varız.Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendinizi zora sokmayın.Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeniden başlamak için geç değil.Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.56,0:20:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid! Dümdüz kırıp geçmek pervasızca bir hareket demiştim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.27,0:20:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heat ve diğerlerinden ayrı düştük...Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az önce omuz omuzaydık...Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama tek başlarına da idare ederler.Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.62,0:21:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi öldürürsek terfi alacağımıza eminim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.75,0:21:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen durun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama sizi arıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle uğraşmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahat bırakın beni!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Genç Efendi! Lütfen durun! – Genç Efendi! Lütfen durun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.13,0:21:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gardınızı indirirseniz ölürsünüz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay!Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.85,0:21:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay! İyi misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.15,0:21:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni sakın bırakma! Sensiz beter olurum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.74,0:21:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sen!Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl...Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.83,0:21:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay'e bunu nasıl yaparsın?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.87,0:21:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın benim Pay-Pay'ime zorbalık yapmaya kalkma!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.88,0:22:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merdivenlerden aşağı kaymak için onu kullanan sendin.Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adın ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.10,0:22:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim için çalışıyorsun ve hangi birimdensin?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.14,0:22:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, abla...Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçeri sızmış biri o.Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.31,0:22:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.56,0:22:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı olacak kişiyim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.00,0:22:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimin kalesinde olduğunun farkında mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.17,0:22:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı olacak kişi, elbette Kaido-sama'dır!Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni ucube salak!Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.05,0:22:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafatasını ezeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.85,0:22:54.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafa mı atıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.85,0:22:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti Havanı!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.60,0:23:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, abla!Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.43,0:23:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farkındayım...Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.15,0:23:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de hissettin mi?Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.36,0:23:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.47,0:24:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm ama..Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.10,0:24:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,neden dönüştünüz ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.85,0:24:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Page One-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.99,0:24:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-sama?Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.49,0:24:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey...Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.37,0:24:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini.Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.37,0:24:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dönüştük çünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.87,0:24:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o herif cidden tehlikeli.Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.79,0:24:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, hayır, imkânsız!Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.17,0:24:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafasına öyle bir vurdunuz ki geberip gitmiş olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.51,0:24:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse şu haki'yi nasıl açıklayacaksın?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu acıttı!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.73,0:25:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu herifler inanılmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.23,0:25:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlardan sürüyle var.Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.40,0:25:11.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi hafife alarak...Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.78,0:25:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hata yapmışım.Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.66,0:25:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kale bir Yonko'ya ait!Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.17,0:25:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin, sizi aptallar!Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.50,0:25:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karşınızda Şogun Orochi'den sürpriz bir özel etkinlik!Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.31,0:25:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.68,0:25:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu veleti size tanıtmama izin verin...Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.40,0:25:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nefeslerinizi tutun ve iyi bakın...Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.32,0:25:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karşınızda 20 yıl önce öldüğünü  sandığımız Kozuki Oden'in oğlu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.45,0:25:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.10,0:26:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Abla!Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.24,0:26:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.37,0:26:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fil Silahı!Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Page One-sama! – İyi misiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.30,0:26:50.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Page One-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.17,0:26:56.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik sıçan!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.26,0:27:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay'e bunu nasıl yaparsın?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.40,0:27:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni yok edeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.44,0:27:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-sama da dinazora dönüştü!Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.03,0:27:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen! Kale daha fazlasını kaldıramaz!Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.16,0:27:18.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,O... Çok güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.37,0:27:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti Meteor!Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.83,0:27:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hass!Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.17,0:27:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dördüncü Vites!Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.14,0:27:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gök Gürültüsü Bagua!Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.46,0:28:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.55,0:28:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sensin, değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.43,0:29:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim.Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.43,0:29:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.35,0:29:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.57,0:29:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin be?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.70,0:29:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.49,0:29:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalayın onu!Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.21,0:29:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm!Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.58,0:29:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni incitmeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.63,0:29:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, incitecek gibi durmuyorsun...Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.47,0:29:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle, benim gitmem gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.10,0:29:47.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni bekliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.89,0:29:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda! Sonunda geldin!Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.94,0:29:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, seni bekliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.94,0:29:59.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem de çok uzun zamandır!Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.20,0:30:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım, Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.33,0:30:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun oğluyum!Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.90,0:01:39.20,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,YıldırımDialogue: 1,0:01:31.90,0:01:39.20,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,YıldırımDialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:01.10,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.05,0:04:01.10,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.05,0:04:01.10,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:01.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.10,0:04:01.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.10,0:04:01.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:01.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.14,0:04:01.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.14,0:04:01.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:01.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.18,0:04:01.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Orochi'nin CasusuDialogue: 1,0:04:01.18,0:04:01.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Kanjuro Şogun Or